01:42:07,694 --> 01:42:09,182
然后你看到下一行。
and then you see the next line.

1222
01:42:09,390 --> 01:42:14,756
你把它传回 GPU 处理器，再应用一次余弦函数，然后再次传回来。
you ship it back to the GPU processor, you apply another cosine, and you ship it back again.

